iteyopheyaa kaaalame sosetu teleqe yaaberehaame hayemaanotoche gaare taarikaawi genenyunate alaate. 
keresetenaane baaraatanyaawe meeta-aamate taqabelaalache. 
kahhezebu anede sosetanyaawe eselaame nawe. 
yamajamariyaawe yaeselaame hijeraa wada iteyopheyaa nawe yatakanaawanawe. 
nagaashe baaferikaa yamajamariyaawe yaeselaame maqamachaa naate. 
eseka 1970 wochu derase bezu beeta-eseraaeeloche baiteyopheyaa yenoru nabare. 
yaraase tafari eneqeseqaasee iteyopheyaane bateleqe kebere nawe yamiyaayaate.
